  "title": "2026-07-29-eval-202743 · llm-inference-gateway",
  "description": "# LLM inference gateway with routing and fallback\n\nA left-to-right system diagram showing how capability-tier requests enter one gateway endpoint, pass identity and admission controls, use cache and policy-aware routing, dispatch across protected hosted and self-hosted capacity, and stream results back. Branches make overload, deadline expiry, spend ceilings, retryable pre-stream failures, non-retryable failures, and post-stream failure behavior explicit. Side flows capture circuit-breaker health, evaluation shadowing, billing metering, and redacted audit records.",
  "mode": "diagram",
